{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"সুনান ইবনে মাজাহ","section":{"1":"The Book of Purification and its Sunnah"},"section_detail":{"1":{"hadithnumber_first":267,"hadithnumber_last":666,"arabicnumber_first":267,"arabicnumber_last":666,"name_native":"পবিত্রতা অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":476,"arabicnumber":476,"text":"। ইবনু আব্বাস (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন, নবী সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম এর এ ঘুম ছিল বসা অবস্থায়।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Munkar"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Munkar"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":1,"hadith":210}}]}